          "snippet": {
            "text": "theorem one_active_state {B q m : ℕ} (hm : m < B) (hm0 : 0 < m) (σ : ℕ → ℕ → ℕ)\n    (hσ : ∀ i < m, ∀ t ≤ q, σ i t ≤ 1) :\n    (∑ i ∈ range m, ∑ t ∈ range (q + 1), σ i t * B ^ t = ∑ t ∈ range (q + 1), B ^ t ∧\n      ∑ t ∈ range (q + 1), σ (m - 1) t * B ^ t = B ^ q) ↔\n    (∀ t ≤ q, ∃! i, i < m ∧ σ i t = 1) ∧ (∀ t ≤ q, σ (m - 1) t = 1 ↔ t = q) := by",
